Subject: [PATCH] Bluetooth: btintel: fix ptr_ret.cocci warnings
Message-ID: <20180822015950.cgvy5wvcdwarka7r@wfg-t540p.sh.intel.com>
References: <1534844080-31240-1-git-send-email-raghuram.hegde@intel.com>
